# The Special:RunQuery game-search pages, so the search form can be exercised
# locally. The landing page embeds all three sport forms; the Form: pages are
# listed explicitly because RunQuery references them by name rather than
# transcluding them, so Special:Export's templates=1 does not pull them in.
# The query templates themselves ARE transcluded, hence their helper chain
# (המרות/..., פרק) arrives automatically.
חיפוש משחק
טופס:חיפוש משחק כדורגל
טופס:חיפוש משחק כדורסל
טופס:חיפוש משחק כדורעף
תבנית:QueryGamesTemplate
תבנית:SearchBasketballGames
תבנית:SearchVolleyballGames
